              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulikuwa na Mlawi mmoja, mzaliwa wa Kupro, jina lake Yosefu, ambaye mitume walimwita Barnaba (maana yake, “Mtu mwenye kutia moyo”). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.4.36",
